          "text": {
            "zhCN": "方式：letter-of-credit；装运前开立不可撤销信用证；信用证应允许分批议付并于装运后21日有效；开证行费用由买方承担，卖方银行费用由卖方承担",
            "enUS": "Method: letter-of-credit; An irrevocable letter of credit shall be issued before shipment.; The credit shall permit partial drawings and remain valid for 21 days after shipment.; Issuing-bank charges are for the Buyer; the Seller bears its bank charges."
          }
        }
      ]
